 the chance  to settle things with your rival once  and for all  [Music]  in the next chapter of possibly animes  most iconic rivalries Goku takes on  Marjan Vegeta when this battle came out  it was one of the most anticipated  battles in the Dragon Ball series  featuring the much awaited rematch  between Goku and Vegeta this isn't just  a battle it's an illustration of how far  these characters have come it may not be  a death battle like the first fight but  it has more to it than what people  typically give it credit for  personally the fight had all the  elements of a classic DBZ fight but I'd  like to focus on the surprising depth  this fight had Goku actually had access  to ssj3 but held back well we can also  see how far Vegeta had gone in his mad  quest for power I think some are  disappointed by the fight because of  hindsight as knowing that Goku could  have easily won and just allowed his  opponent to fight him on an equal field  seems to cheapen everything but as I  said I actually think that knowledge  improved my opinion of the fight given  the reasons above  we cap off this list with probably the  most storied fighting Shonen anime  history naruto vs sasuke these two have  been through a lot haven't they destined  to be rivals whose fates intertwined  naruto and sasuke had their decisive  final showdown at the end of the series  throughout err Sasuke's been that one  major obstacle that one wall to climb  that one symbol the stands obviously  everything that a jumpsuit wearing ninja  stands for it's only fitting that they  had one final battle after all Naruto  did spend half the series looking for  Sasuke and their previous confrontations  have generally ended in Sasuke favor  this time with Madara and Kaguya taking  care of Naruto has one last thing left  to do not the edge out of his old buddy  fittingly the latter has the same idea  and fight they did they put on a show to  be remembered coming at each other with  the peak evolution of their power